     * </p>
     * <p>The column names returned by
     * <b>SQLITE_ASSOC</b> and <b>SQLITE_BOTH</b> will be
     * case-folded according to the value of the
     * {@link https://php-legacy-docs.zend.com/manual/php5/en/sqlite.configuration.php#ini.sqlite.assoc-case sqlite.assoc_case} configuration
     * option.</p>
     */
