 * or <b>NULL</b> if the <i>variable_name</i> variable is not set.
 * If the flag <b>FILTER_NULL_ON_FAILURE</b> is used, it
 * returns <b>FALSE</b> if the variable is not set and <b>NULL</b> if the filter fails.
 */
