     * The second string to compare.
     * </p>
     * @return int|false Return comparison result:</p>
     * <p>
     * <p>
     * 1 if <i>str1</i> is greater than
     * <i>str2</i> ;
     * </p>
     * <p>
     * 0 if <i>str1</i> is equal to
     * <i>str2</i>;
     * </p>
     * <p>
     * -1 if <i>str1</i> is less than
     * <i>str2</i> .
     * </p>
     * On error
     * boolean
     * <b>FALSE</b>
     * is returned.
