 * PKCOLUMN_NAME
 * FKTABLE_QUALIFIER
 * FKTABLE_OWNER
 * FKTABLE_NAME
 * FKCOLUMN_NAME
 * KEY_SEQ
 * UPDATE_RULE
 * DELETE_RULE
 * FK_NAME
 * PK_NAME
 * </p>
 * <p>
 * If <i>pk_table</i> contains a table name,
 * <b>odbc_foreignkeys</b> returns a result set
 * containing the primary key of the specified table and all of the
