 * </tr>
 * <tr valign="top">
 * <td>private_key_bits</td>
 * <td>integer</td>
 * <td>default_bits</td>
 * <td>Specifies how many bits should be used to generate a private
 * key</td>
 * </tr>
 * <tr valign="top">
 * <td>private_key_type</td>
 * <td>integer</td>
 * <td>none</td>
