 * <li>
 * <b>LC_ALL</b> for all of the below
 * </li>
 * <li>
 * <b>LC_COLLATE</b> for string comparison, see
 * {@see strcoll()}
 * </li>
 * <li>
 * <b>LC_CTYPE</b> for character classification and conversion, for
 * example {@see strtoupper()}
 * </li>
 * <li>
 * <b>LC_MONETARY</b> for {@see localeconv()}
 * </li>
 * <li>
