 * of the following:
 * <table>
 * Possible values for flags
 * <tr valign="top">
 * <td>STREAM_OOB</td>
 * <td>
 * Process OOB (out-of-band) data.
 * </td>
 * </tr>
 * <tr valign="top">
 * <td>STREAM_PEEK</td>
